      "label": "After dark",
      "default": "off",
      "help": "Uses sunrise and sunset for the cell's (or the app's) location. Asleep shows the moon and the last bird heard once nothing has called for 90 minutes after dark. Night birds keeps only the birds heard since sunset on the sheet after dark.",
